     <P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">各支部、处室、年级、学科：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">现将《绍兴市第一中学<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>学年工作要点》印发给你们，并根据《绍兴市第一中学<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>学年重点工作任务清单》（附件一）和《绍兴市第一中学<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>学年第一学期行事历》（附件二），请结合实际，予以贯彻落实。</SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                         </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                     </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">   绍兴市第一中学<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                        </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                    </SPAN>2019</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>9</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>20</SPAN>日</SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 22pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast">绍兴市第一中学<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>学年工作要点<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">高举习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想伟大旗帜，贯彻落实全国、全省、全市教育大会精神，坚持立德树人，坚持素质教育，坚持深化教育教学改革。根据《绍兴一中<SPAN lang=EN-US>2017-2020</SPAN>三年发展规划》，以“五星育人、三名争创”为总抓手，以学校凝聚力建设为重点，“学为中心”机制体制创新为突破口，“五育并举”培育新时代人才为落脚点<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>实现教育教学核心指标全市领先和家长满意率进市直学校前三两大目标，做好全国文明校园和省现代化创建准备工作，下好绍兴一中高水平发展先手棋。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 31.7pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.98; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">一、着重落实，抓实五项政策实施。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>1.</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">五星三名。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">对标 “五星育人、三名争创”考核细则，落实整改达标措施，高分通过市教育局评估。提升学校党建文化，规范一中党委和各支部标准化建设，组织建国<SPAN lang=EN-US>70</SPAN>周年特殊主题党日活动，制定实施学校党员教师工作规范，建立年轻党团员教师先锋队，全面加强学校党建工作。高标准组织开展“不忘初心，牢记使命”主题教育活动。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>2.</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">立德树人。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">根据《中心小学德育工作指南》和《中小学生日常行为规范》，完善学校德育工作体系。加强学校意识形态工作，抓好学生理想信念、社会主义核心价值观和优秀传统文化教育。制定并规范实施综合实践活动、劳动教育方案。建设</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">“<SPAN lang=EN-US>4+1</SPAN>”德育微创新品牌。<SPAN style="COLOR: black" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>3.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">攻坚计划。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">根据《绍兴市高中阶段教育高水平发展攻坚计划（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2018-2020</SPAN>）》，实施《绍兴一中高水平发展攻坚计划（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2018-2020</SPAN>）》，定位科学高中，建设学校个性化教育教学核心竞争品牌，促进学校特色发展。制定全国文明校园和省现代化学校创建规划，以创促改，提高学校整体办学水平。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>4.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">普高提质。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">对标“普高提质<SPAN lang=EN-US>50</SPAN>条”中的学校<SPAN lang=EN-US>23</SPAN>条工作，完善学校“普高提质<SPAN lang=EN-US>50</SPAN>条”实施细则，制定尖子生、临界生、后进生实施细则，提升教学质量，拓展尖子生升学路径，提高一段率。根据《绍兴市关于进一步推进高中阶段学校考试招生制度改革的实施意见》，优化学校自主招生政策，吸纳各地优秀生源。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>5.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">绩效考核。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">根据《绍兴市第一中学绩效工资考核实施办法》，制定配套细则，规范学校各类考核和绩效工资发放。规范学校编外人员聘用及待遇发放工作。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 31.7pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.98; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体">二、着心学生，办好五件惠生实事。</SPAN><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>6.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">个案制定。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">借力信息化手段</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">，分析学生学业水平，根据分析情况，为每一个学生制定学生德智体美劳全面发展，个性特长发展情况分析报告，以报告为指导，形成家、校、生三方统一认识，精准帮助学生素质素养提升。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>7.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">精准帮扶。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">依据学生发展情况分析报告，通过“补弱承包”、“补短承包”等形式，充分利用晚自修、周六和碎片化时间，精准帮扶尖子生、临界生、后进生等学生群体</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>8.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">全员家访。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">依据学生发展情况分析报告，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">组织校领导、中层、班主任等做好全员家访工作，促进了解，提升家校合力和家长满意度。<B><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>9.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">身心健康。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">对接专家提高学校心理健康教育水平，制定学校心理疏导实施方案，全面摸查心理有问题学生，建立并实施一对一帮扶制度。综<SPAN style="COLOR: black">合施策，</SPAN>有效控制学生近视率。根据学生体质健康实际，家校合力提升学生身体素质。切实做好手机、恋爱影响学生情况的管控。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ideograph-numeric; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>10.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">成绩标准。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">制定学校考试成绩标准化制度，将学校期中、期末考试成绩折算成以名次为依据的标准分，解决学生出国、三位一体成绩应用不统一，家长简单用成绩是否及格评价学生等误区困惑。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">三、着力破难，落地五项重点工作。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>11.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">课程设置。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">针对学校课程设置相对单一，选修课程开设困难等问题，做好课程顶层设计，制定“<SPAN lang=EN-US>3+3+3+1</SPAN>”选修课程方案。统筹各年段教学安排，制定并实施集体教学和个性化学习相结合工作制度。建设实施创新班课程体系，深化创新班自主招生、课程设置及教学模式等三个维度研究。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>12.</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">竞赛辅导。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">针对竞赛辅导单打独斗问题。完善竞赛辅导实施办法，将个体承包式辅导转向团队辅导，适度扩大竞赛辅导学生群体，增加竞赛辅导附加价值。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>13.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">课堂质量。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">针对课堂教学方式单一，质量效益不高等问题，完善教研组、备课组工作制度，加强教研组、备课组合力，实施校领导推门听课和个别教师专项听课制度。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>14.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">精准管理。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">针对学校信息化水平不高、应用不多情况，建设智慧校园管理系统，拓展无纸化、最多跑一次办公路径，精准分析学科、学生成绩，运用分析系统，建设绍兴一中个性化题库，借助教师力量，建设绍兴一中问题导向微课、微视频。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>15.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">自修提质。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">针对教师晚自修等管理积极性不高，管理不够到位问题，重点改革晚自修管理方式，将学生进行尖子生、临界生、后进生和短板学科分类，组织教师在晚自修时间实施一对一、同学科补短承包式辅导</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">四、着实根本，补强五块学校短板。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>16.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">制度短板。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">根据</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">工作需要，点对点逐步完善各类学校制度，严格制度执行刚性。规范各类面向家长、上级部门文字材料，树立良好形象。统一各类数据统计口径，避免因数据冲突引发次生事件。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>17.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">队伍短板。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">每位教师制定个体发展三年规划。制定市外名师招聘制度，运用三名激励政策优势，招聘名优教师，建设各学科领头羊。利用县管校聘契机，优化教师队伍。加强心理和生涯教育能力培训，建设双师型教师队伍，提高教师个案制定能力。规范年轻教师队伍建设，打造<SPAN lang=EN-US>30-40</SPAN>岁敢管善治班主任队伍，制定加快推进年轻干部培养制度。借力教研院组织名师推介活动。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>18.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">中层短板。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">提升中层干部和处室工作人员行政思维，提高行政工作能力。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">根据市教育局中层聘任政策和学校绩效考核要求，优化中层干部队伍。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>19.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">文化短板。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">系统规划</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">学校校园文化和党建文化建设，形成开放式有理念、有品位的文化呈现系列景观。组织“最美教室、最美寝室、最美办公室”三美评比，优化学校环境。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>20.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">风险短板。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">就预算、收支、采购、资产管理、建设、合同、安全等七大高风险内容建立流程等规范制度体系，规范经费报销，完善校内管控政策制度。全面梳理学校资产，严防国家资产流失。加强党风廉政建设，严防廉政风险。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">五、着力争优，做好五项工作保障。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>21.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">工程建设。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">保质保量做好南校门、风雨连廊等工程，调研完善有序上下学接送工作，对接交警规范家长接送车停放，缓减绿云路、群贤路车辆转弯堵点。改造教师办公室西面立面，改善办公室环境。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>22.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">书院筹建。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">做好</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">龙山书院筹建招生的前期准备工作，做好龙山书院品牌建设顶层设计。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>23.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">初中对接。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">建立</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">学校与初中学校联系人制度，组织班子走访初中学校和初中联系人定期走访联系初中学校。组织与初中学校研讨交流互动活动。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>24.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">教研提质。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">组织</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">“基于学习本质上是一种自学”和元认知理论下的教与学模式研究，以课题统筹学校教育教学思想和教学工作。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>25.</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">奖教奖学。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">用好“英贤计划”等各类奖教奖学基金，拓展渠道吸引各方人士支持。完善制度，发挥基金效益。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 288pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 18.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">绍兴市第一中学<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 288pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 18.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>9</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>日<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 14pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
